# Tools work faster, as in Raspberry Flavoured: a longer early game should not
# be a slower one. The base is stored on the player, so this runs once per
# player through the hidden advancement wly:internal/harvest_speed_v1. To change
# the value for everyone, change it here and bump the advancement to _v2.
attribute @s minecraft:player.block_break_speed base set 1.25
